# Media Library screen

The Media Library lists every file you upload to your site. Use it to find, filter, and delete files.

## Open the Media Library

To open the Media Library, go to **Media > Library**. The grid view shows each file as a thumbnail.

![Media items in grid view.](media-library-grid-view.png)

## [Filter your files](#filter-your-files)

1. Select a file type from the first list.
2. Select a date from the second list.
3. Enter a word in **Search media items**.

Each choice narrows the results. For more information about uploads, see [Add New Media File](/documentation/article/media-add-new-screen/).

